WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.672
Sign in and open your hub.

00:00:01.672 --> 00:00:06.239
Under Working the night, select the event card to open your host tools.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:09.583
View live card opens the same flyer your guests see.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:11.377
Expand Night in numbers.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.768
Interested counts event follows.

00:00:13.768 --> 00:00:15.711
Going counts active RSVPs.

00:00:15.711 --> 00:00:18.103
Expected counts accepted guests.

00:00:18.103 --> 00:00:21.167
Checked in follows successful door scans.

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.453
Scroll to your list.

00:00:22.453 --> 00:00:24.383
Pending spots need a response.

00:00:24.383 --> 00:00:26.442
Accepted guests are on the list.

00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:28.436
Arrived guests have checked in.

00:00:28.436 --> 00:00:32.167
Your role determines which guest and team controls appear.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:36.420
From your own hub, find the event under Guest spots and passes.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.040
Accept to join the list.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.863
Decline to return the spot.

00:00:39.863 --> 00:00:42.833
Gift this spot transfers it to someone else.

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:46.302
Accepting opens the pass and joins the event chat.

00:00:46.302 --> 00:00:49.423
Later, choose View pass to show the QR again.

00:00:49.423 --> 00:00:51.851
Download PDF saves an offline copy.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:55.667
Gifting or regenerating the pass replaces the old code.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.387
Open Event Mode and select Door check-in.

00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:00.378
Scan the QR or enter its code.

00:01:00.378 --> 00:01:02.701
A successful scan confirms arrival.

00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:06.417
Scanning the same code again shows the earlier check-in.

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:08.888
Choose Bar service and check the pass.

00:01:08.888 --> 00:01:11.619
Select the drink or discount to redeem it.

00:01:11.619 --> 00:01:15.326
Here, one twenty percent discount becomes zero remaining.

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:17.667
Only a listed offer can be redeemed.

